            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Deadlatch, Baldwin 5210</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUniversal Deadlocking Latch for Baldwin Estates Keyed Entry Knobs and Levers.  Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\" Backset.  Available in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of Baldwin 5210 Deadlatch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hub Rotation 28 degrees for easy turning</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Head features anti-friction insert for smooth operation</li>\r\n<li>Latches have a 1/2\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolts are non-handed </li>\r\n<li>Fully adjustable fronts for use on beveled doors</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Supplied with 1\" (25mm) face plate</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
